<sect2 id="md__2home_2umar_2Desktop_2WorkShop_2GLL_2centry_2README_1autotoc_md14">
<title>COMPILE</title>
<para><bold>We strongly recommend using the <ulink url="https://mesonbuild.com/">Meson Build System</ulink> to build the project.</bold></para>
<para><programlisting filename=".bash"><codeline><highlight class="normal">$&gt;<sp/><sp/>meson<sp/>setup<sp/>build<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$&gt;<sp/><sp/>meson<sp/>compile<sp/>-C<sp/>build<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">$&gt;<sp/><sp/>meson<sp/>install<sp/>-C<sp/>build<sp/><sp/>#To<sp/>install<sp/>localy<sp/></highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>To uninstall <programlisting filename=".bash"><codeline><highlight class="normal">#&gt;<sp/>ninja<sp/>uninstall<sp/>-C<sp/>build<sp/></highlight></codeline>
